<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, APRIL 11.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, APRIL 11.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	April 11    April 10   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  270.840     269.910     247.020    9.64 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  307.220     307.090     306.830    0.13 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.300     157.095     158.970   -1.05 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.768	46.668	47.182   -0.88 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  440.340     437.700     419.180    5.05 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.955     139.695     141.685   -1.22 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.948	15.910	16.185   -1.46 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  214.960     213.950     212.430    1.19 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.869	 1.861	 1.888   -1.01 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.574	 1.568	 1.581   -0.44 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  184.600     183.280     183.135    0.80 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
